<title>UK: Russia Gazprom ADS up again on 2nd day.</title>
<headline>Russia Gazprom ADS up again on 2nd day.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Depositary Shares in Russian energy giant RAO Gazprom rose $1.50 cents in early London trading to $19.75/$20.25 by 0910 GMT after strong demand for the stock from U.S. and British investors, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock is going very well, there is strong demand,&quot; said the head of Russia trading at a bank in London.</p>
<p>Gazprom was priced at $15.75 per ADS late on Monday and the ADS went as high as $19.50 on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;At the levels we are seeing on Wednesday, I would be tempted to take profits,&quot; said the trader.</p>
<p>The underlying stock was quoted at 50 cents.</p>
<p>Each ADS represents 10 underlying shares.</p>
<p>-- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
